WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:07.257
Seiya, I thought
you were smarter than this!

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:12.053
If you won't give up, then I'm
gonna have to tear you apart!

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:13.179
[roars]

00:00:16.766 --> 00:00:18.685
[groaning]

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.688
[Marin] Seiya, burn your Cosmo!

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:25.692
Focus your body and spirit
to the strike point,

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:27.277
to your hand!

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.196
[yells]

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:33.992
What the hell?

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:39.497
Cassios! You can't
lose the Armor to Seiya!

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.499
[growls] I won't.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:47.464
Cassios, I don't want
to have to hurt you.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.008
If you surrender,
you can still walk away.

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.134
[chuckles]

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.262
You won't be
walking away from this. [grunts]

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:58.433
I won't let you win the Armor!

00:00:58.516 --> 00:01:00.643
[roars]

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:01.519
What?

00:01:01.644 --> 00:01:04.105
You just don't get it, do you?

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:07.776
You use Cosmo, but you use
only a fraction of its power.

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:09.861
What are you saying?

00:01:09.944 --> 00:01:11.529
[Seiya] You've never even seen

00:01:11.654 --> 00:01:13.948
the universe
within your own body.

00:01:14.032 --> 00:01:17.077
[Marin] Huh. As if
you've already mastered it.

00:01:18.119 --> 00:01:20.205
[Cassios]
The universe in my body?!

00:01:22.123 --> 00:01:23.374
[Seiya grunts]

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:31.091
You can do better
if you can utilize all your Cosmo.

00:01:31.174 --> 00:01:34.094
You and the stars
are made of the same atoms.

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.389
In the beginning,
everything in the universe

00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:40.100
was born from the Big Bang.

00:01:40.683 --> 00:01:44.354
Your body is
its own mini-universe.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:48.900
True Knights can generate power
by igniting their own Cosmo.

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:52.112
They can split the Earth
and smash the stars.

00:01:52.195 --> 00:01:55.365
Seiya, burn your Cosmo.

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:58.868
Make your inner universe
explode.

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:03.623
Then your attacks will hit
with all the power of a meteor.

00:02:09.838 --> 00:02:14.092
Seiya's hands are tracing
the 13 stars of Pegasus!

00:02:19.556 --> 00:02:22.475
I'm bigger. I'm stronger.

00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:24.644
I'm a lot smarter than you.

00:02:24.727 --> 00:02:27.564
You don't have a universe
inside your body!

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:28.731
No, Cassios!

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:30.066
Get away from Seiya!

00:02:30.859 --> 00:02:33.444
[Seiya] Pegasus Ryu-Sei-Ken!

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:34.445
What?!

00:02:35.029 --> 00:02:36.447
[yells]

00:02:36.531 --> 00:02:38.950
[groaning]

